  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產品與製程優化技術",
    "sub_ename": "OPTIMIZATION TECHNOLOGY OF PRODUCT AND PROCESS",
    "describe_ch": "產業界經常面臨到產品開發創新及製程技術提昇等問題，優化技術可讓產品設計人員與製程技術人員來助益產品與製程的研發效能，本課程旨在培養研究生具備產品開發創新及製程技術提昇的基礎能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The industry often faces challenges in both product development innovation and process technology enhancement. Optimization technology can help product designers and process technology personnel improving the research and development efficiency of products and processes. The purpose of this course is to cultivate graduate students with the basic abilities to innovate in product development and enhance process technology.",
